            "<BOS> AI helps doctors                        → predicted: review     | target: diagnose\n",
            "<BOS> AI helps doctors diagnose               → predicted: disease    | target: disease\n",
            "<BOS> AI helps doctors diagnose disease       → predicted: <EOS>      | target: <EOS>\n"
          ]
